          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"counting-with-a-dictionary\">Counting with a dictionary</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">A week of order statuses. The dictionary starts empty, and each status either gets its first count or adds one to the count it already has. <code>.get(_status, 0)</code> is what makes the first time work.</span></span>"
