          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"4-choosing-a-data-structure\">4. Choosing a Data Structure</h1>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>read by</th>\n<th>can change</th>\n<th>keeps each value</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>list</strong></td>\n<td>position</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>as often as it appears</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>tuple</strong></td>\n<td>position</td>\n<td>no</td>\n<td>as often as it appears</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>dictionary</strong></td>\n<td>key</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>keys once each</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>set</strong></td>\n<td>membership only</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>once</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "yCnT",
      "code_hash": "1f8ec4989f418d94de26cf9165d7d390",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Four questions, asked in order, from <a href=\"/handbooks/python/02-collections/#19-choosing-a-data-structure\">Python \u00a719</a>:</span>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Are you only asking whether you have seen a value before?</strong> A set. Stop here.</li>\n<li><strong>Is it one thing with named parts?</strong> A dictionary. If the parts must never change, a tuple.</li>\n<li><strong>Is it many of the same thing?</strong> A list.</li>\n<li><strong>Does each of those things have named parts?</strong> Then a list of dictionaries, which is a table.</li>\n</ol></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
